{"vid":"rlOEBAIkmwg","source":"rlOEBAIkmwg.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":27,"txt":"Turn right side down."},{"t":45.9,"txt":"you know, I wasn't really sure what I"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"wanted to do at the time. I, you know,"},{"t":49.7,"txt":"kind of roamed and rogued, you know,"},{"t":51.6,"txt":"checked out various classes and"},{"t":54.1,"txt":"different, you know, programs. Never"},{"t":56.5,"txt":"really found anything that I really"},{"t":57.8,"txt":"liked. Well, I came in here and I signed"},{"t":59.6,"txt":"up for a welding class and it was just"},{"t":62.7,"txt":"an immediate, you know, that's it. This"},{"t":65.1,"txt":"is kind of what I really want to do."},{"t":67.2,"txt":"When I finally decided that it was time"},{"t":69.8,"txt":"for me to get an education, I looked"},{"t":71.4,"txt":"into the local community college and"},{"t":74.2,"txt":"they had um one of the best welding"},{"t":76.6,"txt":"programs in the world. So, I thought I"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"would give it a try. I was really big"},{"t":80.2,"txt":"into art in high school, so it sounded"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"fun. I thought I was just uh going to"},{"t":86.2,"txt":"try it out. But once I was there, I"},{"t":88.4,"txt":"absolutely fell in love with"},{"t":106.7,"txt":"it. Welding was kind of a never-ending"},{"t":109.5,"txt":"struggle to learn something. Uh it's not"},{"t":112.1,"txt":"it is a science. It's also an art form."},{"t":114,"txt":"So, you never really um you never"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"achieve your goal. You're always"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"striving to get a little bit better and"},{"t":119.2,"txt":"there's always something else to learn."},{"t":120.6,"txt":"So, it's really a neverending education."},{"t":123.3,"txt":"I like that. I love welding and chose a"},{"t":125.8,"txt":"career in the welding industry because"},{"t":128.6,"txt":"there were so many different facets of"},{"t":131.4,"txt":"the industry that I wasn't originally"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"aware of. Um there's so many different"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"levels or paths you can take within the"},{"t":137.9,"txt":"industry. Um, and I like the idea that I"},{"t":141.4,"txt":"have no idea where I'm going to be in 10"},{"t":143,"txt":"years. And um, you know, just from five"},{"t":146,"txt":"years ago, I've been able to learn so"},{"t":149.3,"txt":"much. And every day I'm doing something"},{"t":151.4,"txt":"different. It's not the same mundane"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"thing every single day."},{"t":177.8,"txt":"It can be applied to pretty much"},{"t":179.3,"txt":"anything. Anything that you can almost"},{"t":182.3,"txt":"think of, welding is there. if some"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"facet in whatever that program or"},{"t":187.2,"txt":"whatever that job or whatever that"},{"t":188.6,"txt":"career there may be something that deals"},{"t":191.1,"txt":"with materials, metals or welding in"},{"t":194.1,"txt":"general. And it's I mean you can almost"},{"t":196.4,"txt":"go anywhere with it. So it's it's"},{"t":198.1,"txt":"perfect."},{"t":199.8,"txt":"It's awesome to work somewhere where"},{"t":201.3,"txt":"you're not pigeonholed into one thing or"},{"t":204.2,"txt":"one industry or one product. We really"},{"t":206.9,"txt":"literally get our hands in everything"},{"t":209.1,"txt":"that you interact with every day. I"},{"t":211.4,"txt":"think it's really interesting that, you"},{"t":213,"txt":"know, most people walk around every day"},{"t":215.1,"txt":"not thinking about, you know, how much"},{"t":217.5,"txt":"welding affects our lives and where we"},{"t":219.6,"txt":"would be without it. It's it's amazing."}],"words":[{"t":27.039,"w":"Turn"},{"t":27.439,"w":"right"},{"t":28.32,"w":"side"},{"t":28.64,"w":"down."},{"t":45.92,"w":"you"},{"t":46.079,"w":"know,"},{"t":46.239,"w":"I"},{"t":46.399,"w":"wasn't"},{"t":46.64,"w":"really"},{"t":46.879,"w":"sure"},{"t":47.039,"w":"what"},{"t":47.2,"w":"I"},{"t":47.36,"w":"wanted"},{"t":47.6,"w":"to"},{"t":47.76,"w":"do"},{"t":48,"w":"at"},{"t":48.16,"w":"the"},{"t":48.399,"w":"